1b:T7f1,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"泰山机场（TaiShan Net）跑路了吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"截至2026年9月26日没有跑路：用户中心可以注册、下单，7月16日还发布了2.0.6版客户端，国庆优惠码也在发。但GitHub上的跑路预警#195从4月3日开放至今，起因是4月初除香港外的节点全部超时，6月仍有用户反馈香港节点间歇超时，建议只买短周期。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"TaiShan Net官网是哪个？为什么打不开？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"主站是 taishan.pro，但国内DNS被污染，大陆直接打开通常失败。官方公布的永久地址是 jp.taishan.app 和 jp.taishan.pro，其中 jp.taishan.app 国内解析正常，打开后会跳到官方用户中心 ts5.t11-b.app，账号与主站互通。taishan.my 不是官网，它的按钮通向宝妈云。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"TaiShan Net有优惠码或折扣码吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"有。国庆节假期8折优惠码 vgD9UubN，有效期到2026年10月7日24:00，六个套餐所有周期都能用。网上流传的 taishan、taishan88、ts88 都是无效码。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"TaiShan Net客户端在哪下载？能用Clash吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Windows、安卓和Mac（M芯片与Intel）的自研客户端在用户中心首页下载，登录账号就能连。后台也提供订阅链接，可以导入Clash Verge、FClash等客户端，但官方自4月起建议优先用自研客户端，旧版Clash for Windows不兼容。iOS需要非中国大陆Apple ID下载Nextin，站点代码填 taishan。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"TaiShan Net最便宜多少钱？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"能月付的最低档是128G每月13元；64G档不能月付，年付88元折合每月约7.3元。每GB最便宜的是512G年付350元，约0.057元/GB，用国庆8折码后是280元。"}}]}11:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-12","children":["$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a",["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1b"}}],["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"my-6 border-l-2 border-accent bg-card py-3 pr-3 pl-4 font-serif text-lg leading-8 text-foreground/85 not-italic","children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"30 秒结论"}]}],["$","$1","1",{"children":"：泰山机场（TaiShan Net）"}],["$","$1","2",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"还在正常卖"}]}]